Obsidian is the selected workspace profile.

- Favor wiki links and directory navigation over exported indexes.
- Use `export dashboard --viewer obsidian` when you want a review workbench with topic dossiers and queue indexes.
- Treat `.obsidian/` as starter-kit workspace state scaffolded during init, then customized directly in Obsidian.
- Use the generated workflow notes as operational guidance, not as synced plugin config.
